    <string name="wiring_title">Wiring</string>
    <string name="wiring_body">Sensor → USB-RS485 adapter:\n• Brown (V+) → power supply 5–24 V DC (+)\n• Black (GND) → power supply (−) and adapter GND\n• Yellow (A+) → adapter A+ / 485+\n• Blue (B−) → adapter B− / 485−\nPlug the adapter into the phone through an OTG cable. Sensor defaults: ID 1, 4800 bps, 8N1.</string>

